@page "/security"
<h2>Bank-Grade Security - Zero Financial Risk</h2>
<h3>1. We Don’t Touch the Money </h3>
<p>EMA is a data bridge, not a bank. After the funds have moved directly from the Donor’s bank to your Nonprofit's bank,
     we process the information from the Interac email notification, creating a record of the donation in your ChMS.  We never hold, freeze, or delay your funds.
</p>
<h3>2. Designed for security and auditability.</h3>
<ul>
    <li>Two-Factor Authentication (2FA): Enforced for production logins to prevent unauthorized access. Generated sandbox users bypass email verification because sandbox email addresses are test-only.</li>
    <li>Full Audit Trails: Every change to donor records or fund allocation is permanently logged. You always know who did what and when.</li>
</ul>

<h3>3. Canadian Data Sovereignty </h3>
<p>All donor data is encrypted and stored on secure Microsoft Azure servers physically located within Canada—never offshore.</p>
